{{!--
  career-profile.md.hbs — renders CareerProfile (career-profile.schema.json)
  into the file the person owns and edits (mvp-spec §3 F5). Section order
  and headings below are exact, per the P01 packet spec.

  Render context (a view-model derived from CareerProfile, not the raw
  schema shape — the renderer, not this template, partitions `claims[]` by
  status; see the P01 report for why "Presentation that can change" isn't a
  literal ClaimStatus value):
    {
      profileVersion: number | null,   // approval.version, or null if never approved
      approvedAt: string | null,       // approval.at (ISO-8601), or null
      confirmedClaims:      [{ id, text, kind, source }],
      presentationClaims:   [{ id, text, kind, source }], // confirmed claims whose wording is still adjustable
      needsDecisionClaims:  [{ id, text, kind, question }], // status: candidate | disputed, with an open question
      excludedClaims:       [{ id, text, kind }],
      boundaries:  [{ id, text }],
      preferences: [{ id, text }],
    }

  Every claim/boundary/preference line carries its `id` in brackets so
  editing this Markdown and re-parsing it round-trips into career-profile.json
  (F5 accept: "round-trip property test") — P03 owns the parser.
--}}
# Career profile

{{#if profileVersion}}
Approved as version {{profileVersion}} on {{approvedAt}}.
{{else}}
Not yet approved — generation stays locked until every source is accounted for, no claim is left needing a decision, and you approve this profile.
{{/if}}

## Confirmed claims

{{#each confirmedClaims}}
- {{this.text}} `[{{this.id}}]`
{{else}}
_None yet._
{{/each}}

## Presentation that can change

Confirmed, but how it's worded is still open — edit the wording here; the underlying claim doesn't change.

{{#each presentationClaims}}
- {{this.text}} `[{{this.id}}]`
{{else}}
_None._
{{/each}}

## Needs a decision

{{#each needsDecisionClaims}}
- {{this.text}} `[{{this.id}}]`
  - **Question:** {{this.question}}
{{else}}
_Nothing waiting on you._
{{/each}}

## Excluded

Kept here, visibly, so you can see what was left out and why — never used in a generated document.

{{#each excludedClaims}}
- {{this.text}} `[{{this.id}}]`
{{else}}
_None excluded._
{{/each}}

## Boundaries

Rules generation must never cross — an invented metric, a changed date, a changed title, a changed credential.

